      option('promise','Ask him to trust your word','Make no additional change to access or review.',{tTrustRepair:false},'“We’ll see,” Tim says. He returns to the floor before the discussion has finished.','review','A promise does not demonstrate whether the boundary will hold.'),
      option('drop','End the discussion because the settings are your responsibility','Exclude him from the follow-up.',{tVoice:false},'The meeting ends. Tim no longer expects to be asked whether the change works for the people using it.','review','A technical restriction and meaningful worker participation are separate features of the intervention.')
